{"bookId":"cp-2","editionId":"6879da4e6ec271ab","chapterId":"c0017","paragraphs":[{"id":"peb223022d109-1","text":"留春不住。"},{"id":"p631129f84a68-1","text":"费尽莺儿语。"},{"id":"p80188d226e24-1","text":"满地残红宫锦污。"},{"id":"p98aa78d1fde2-1","text":"昨夜南园风雨。"},{"id":"p1d4e918be5dd-1","text":"小怜初上琵琶。"},{"id":"p3d9b44dce101-1","text":"晓来思绕天涯。"},{"id":"p1baf4616d775-1","text":"不肯画堂朱户，春风自在杨花。"}]}